# {{ WIDGET_NAME }}

Generated via SolidJS TypeScript template.

## Client API

This template bundles the client API from the `zebar` package on npm, since
Ninja publishes no package of its own. That is the upstream client, not the
one this build of Ninja serves, so the two can drift apart between versions.

If you hit a mismatch, use the buildless template instead — it imports
`/__ninja/client.js`, which Ninja serves from the running app and is always
in step with it.

## Usage

```bash
$ npm install # or pnpm install or yarn install
```

